 ('No trucks are allowed past the barrier. This vehicle is past the barrier. What follows?', 'This vehicle is not a truck', ['This vehicle is a truck', 'The barrier is broken', 'Trucks may pass at night'], 'If no trucks may pass, and the rule was kept, a vehicle beyond the barrier cannot be a truck.'),
